	<br>
<<else>>
	"폴더 찾아?" <<he>>【이가】 묻는다. "버렸어. 난 잡동사니는 질색이거든."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[쓰레기통을 뒤진다|Mansion Folder Search]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[화낸다|Mansion Folder Angry]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>>
